<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V ENGLAND FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, England 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>second day of the first test between England and Australia at</p>
<p>Edgbaston on Friday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 118 (A.Caddick 5-50)</p>
<p>England first innings (overnight 200-3)</p>
<p> M.Butcher c Healy b Kasprowicz	 8</p>
<p> M.Atherton c Healy b McGrath	   2</p>
<p> A.Stewart c Elliott b Gillespie     18</p>
<p> N.Hussain c Healy b Warne	    207</p>
<p> G.Thorpe c Bevan b McGrath	   138</p>
<p> J.Crawley c Healy b Kasprowicz	 1</p>
<p> M.Ealham not out			  32</p>
<p> R.Croft not out			   18</p>
<p> Extras					25</p>
<p> Total (129.1 overs)		    449</p>
<p>Wicketfalls: 1-8 2-16 3-50 4-338 5-345 6-416</p>
<p>To bat: D.Gough, A.Caddick, D.Malcolm.</p>
<p>Bowling: McGrath 32-8-107-2, Kasprowicz 34.1-7-94-2,</p>
<p>Gillespie 10-1-48-1, Warne 35-8-110-1, Bevan 6-0-34-0, S.R.</p>
<p>Waugh 12-2-45-0</p>
<p>Australia won toss.</p>
</text>
